  NodeId: Beginning_SettingTheScene
  LocationName: Old Road
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: '"You are walking along an old dirt road in the land of Valace. You''re
    a  adventurer who is returning home for a quest. In front of you the path begins
    to split in opposite directions and you don''t remember which path leads home.
    One path goes deeper into the forest and the other appears to approach a mountain
    range. You think that the mountain path is correct. Which path will you take?"'
  Choices:
  - ChoiceText: '[Go Deeper Into the Forest]'
    NextNodeId: 01_Forest01
    ReloadScene: 0
    RequiredFlags: []
    ForbiddenFlags: []
    GrantFlags: []
    GrantQuest: Return Home
  - ChoiceText: '[Go Towards the Mountains]'
